#original-page(612pt, 792pt, (image("graphics/page-02.png", width: 16pt), 264pt, 519pt))[
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72.025pt, 82.28pt, "degrees of freedom as microscopic modes whose occupations are fixed by thermal equilibrium, rather ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 95.03pt, "than as collective modes governed by reduced dynamics. ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 121.55pt, "From an open-system perspective, collective modes couple to their environment through a restricted set of ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 134.05pt, "channels characterized by effective noise and dissipation parameters, rather than by the full thermal bath ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 146.8pt, "of microscopic constituents [5,15,16]. The quantum state of a collective mode is therefore governed by ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 159.55pt, "reduced open-system dynamics in which ambient temperature enters only indirectly, through effective ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 172.05pt, "noise injection into the collective subspace. As a consequence, the robustness of collective quantum ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 184.8pt, "correlations is controlled by the balance between coherent coupling and effective noise, not directly by ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 197.58pt, "the microscopic bath temperature. ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 224.08pt, "In parallel, the experimental certification of quantum correlations in macroscopic systems is ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 236.83pt, "fundamentally constrained by continuous measurement, finite detection bandwidth, and estimator ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 249.33pt, "statistics [17,18]. These operational limitations can obscure the presence of entanglement even when the ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 262.07pt, "underlying quantum state remains nonclassical, leading to experimentally inferred coherence or ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 274.85pt, "entanglement times that reflect measurement precision rather than physical decoherence. ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 301.35pt, "In this work, we develop a minimal, platform-independent framework for understanding entanglement of ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 314.1pt, "spatially separated collective quantum modes under realistic experimental conditions. Our approach does ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 326.6pt, "not introduce new entanglement criteria or measurement protocols. Instead, it establishes an operational ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 339.35pt, "description that connects collective-mode open-system dynamics, effective noise injection, coherent ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 351.85pt, "coupling over distance, and estimator-limited certification. This framework resolves the apparent tension ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 364.62pt, "between macroscopic signal strength, ambient temperature, and quantum inseparability, and identifies the ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 377.37pt, "precise conditions under which macroscopic entanglement can persist and be reliably certified. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
